  <Docs>
    <summary>Container for device info from an association that is not self-managed.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Container for device info from an association that is not self-managed.
            Device can be one of three types:
            
            &lt;ul&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;for classic Bluetooth - <c>android.bluetooth.BluetoothDevice</c>&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;for Bluetooth LE - <c>android.bluetooth.le.ScanResult</c>&lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;for WiFi - <c>android.net.wifi.ScanResult</c>&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;</para>
      <para>
